  "_aboutKinds": "Weapons and off-hands by class (Robin, 2026-11-03). A weapon's number is the slot's rank number times `mult`; two hands leave no hand for an off-hand. A shield's `block` is the share of a blow a Block stops and `dodge` the chance a Dodge misses (\"a buckler might make you dodge 50% of the time, but only block 30%\"); an orb's `mana` is the share a Magician's Mana Shield pays. Each step of rarity adds `qualityStep` to both, each rank `rankStep`. `bare` is no off-hand. Three in four dropped weapons and off-hands are your class's (`ownShare`). All numbers mine.",
